#: title/pc5_web_page.html:49
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem with PC5"
msgstr "PC5の問題を報告"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:52
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Send a game"
msgstr "ゲームを送る"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:53
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Choose a game's folder: it goes to PC5's INSTALL folder, then PC5 asks to "
"install it."
msgstr "ゲームのフォルダーを選んでください。PC5のINSTALLフォルダーに送られ、PC5でインストールするか確認されます。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:55
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose a folder"
msgstr "フォルダーを選ぶ"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:57
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"A phone that can't choose a folder: type the game's folder name, then "
"choose its files."
msgstr "フォルダーを選べないスマートフォンの場合：ゲームのフォルダー名を入力してから、ファイルを選んでください。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:60
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Choose files"
msgstr "ファイルを選ぶ"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:66
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Games"
msgstr "ゲーム"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:66
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "更新"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:68 title/pc5_web_page.html:74
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "読み込み中…"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:71
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Logs"
msgstr "ログ"

#. Web page text.
#. Keep <b>...</b> and <code>...</code> around the same words.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:72
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Attach one to an issue on GitHub when a game has a problem: a game's "
"<b>Report a problem</b> above downloads its newest log and opens GitHub's "
"form with the game, PC5 and its settings filled in."
msgstr ""
"ゲームに問題があるときは、GitHubのIssueにログを添付してください。上にある各ゲームの<b>問題を報告</b>で、最新のログをダウンロードし、ゲーム、PC5、設定が入力済みのGitHubのフォームを開けます。"

#. Web page text.
#. A text box's hint, shown in it while it is empty.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:59
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The game's folder name"
msgstr "ゲームのフォルダー名"

#. Web page text.
#. A text box's hint, shown in it while it is empty.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:67
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Find a game"
msgstr "ゲームを検索"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:103
msgctxt "web"
msgid "bytes"
msgstr "バイト"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:124
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "PC5 %s · %s free on the console"
msgstr "PC5 %s · 本体の空き容量：%s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:125
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid " · INSTALL folder: %s free"
msgstr " · INSTALLフォルダー：空き%s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:127
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The console didn't answer: %s"
msgstr "本体から応答がありません：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:133
msgctxt "web"
msgid "given by you"
msgstr "自分で指定"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:134
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "found in %s"
msgstr "%sで検出"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:134
msgctxt "web"
msgid "none found"
msgstr "見つかりません"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:135
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Which game it is (Steam app ID: %s)"
msgstr "どのゲームか（SteamのアプリID：%s）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:135
msgctxt "web"
msgid "none"
msgstr "なし"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:136
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Steam app ID, e.g. 1091500"
msgstr "SteamのアプリID（例：1091500）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:139 title/pc5_web_page.html:165
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:142 title/pc5_web_page.html:168
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "保存中…"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:146
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Saved: its cover, background and details are fetched again when PC5 opens."
msgstr "保存しました。次にPC5を開いたときに、カバー、背景、詳細をもう一度取得します。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:147
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Cleared: PC5 reads the game's folder again."
msgstr "消去しました。PC5がゲームのフォルダーをもう一度読み込みます。"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:149 title/pc5_web_page.html:174
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not saved: %s"
msgstr "保存できませんでした：%s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:152
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "; GOG product %s"
msgstr "、GOGの製品 %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:153
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"PC5 picks the game's cover, background and details by this number (%s%s). "
"If they are another game's, type the number from the game's Steam store "
"link (store.steampowered.com/app/<number>). Empty: PC5 reads the folder "
"again."
msgstr ""
"PC5はこの番号（%s%s）でゲームのカバー、背景、詳細を選びます。別のゲームのものになっている場合は、ゲームのSteamストアのリンク（store.steampowered.com/app/<番号>）にある番号を入力してください。空欄にすると、PC5がフォルダーをもう一度読み込みます。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:172
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved: used at the game's next start."
msgstr "保存しました。次にゲームを起動したときに使われます。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:187
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "まだゲームがありません。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:190
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "USBドライブ"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:191
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "起動できません"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "設定：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:199
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "最新のログ"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:201
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "問題を報告"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:202
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr "最新のログをダウンロードし、入力済みのGitHubのフォームを開きます。そこにログを添付してください。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:208
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "起動オプション（launch.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:209
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr "空行でもコメント（#や;）でもない最初の行が、プログラムのコマンドラインに追加されます。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:212
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "環境変数（env.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:212
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "1行に1つずつ「NAME=value」の形で書きます。ゲームの起動前に設定されます。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:213
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "追加のログ（winedebug.txt）"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:214
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr "Issueで求められたときだけ使います（例：err+all,+seh）。ゲームが遅くなるので、あとで空にしてください。"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:219
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The games didn't load: %s"
msgstr "ゲームを読み込めませんでした：%s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:232
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No logs kept."
msgstr "保存されているログはありません。"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:236
msgctxt "web"
msgid "had a problem"
